ndon and has a background in acoustical engineering. He lives in Austin, Texas, spends summers working from Sweden, and plays soccer in both places. Tom Bonney Tom is a co-founder of TruSight, Private Equity Info's parent company, following on his career as a serial entrepreneur, investor and professional services leader with over 30 years experience serving middle market firms across North America. He lives with his family in sunny Jupiter, Florida. Sales, Marketing & Customer Relations Research & Customer Relations Reba Kieke Reba is part of Private Equity Info’s research and customer relations team, where she focuses on data accuracy, account management, and customer growth and satisfaction. She lives in the Austin area and enjoys live music, sporting events, and traveling. Senior Vice President, Sales and Strategy Kevin Faroni Kevin is Senior Vice President of Sales & Strategy at Private Equity Info, bringing extensive experience across the M&A ecosystem working with PE firms, Corp M&A, Family Offices, Investment Banks, Intermediaries, and Business Owners on deal origination and execution. Outside of work, you’ll likely find him on his bike or trading the NYC skyline for the coastlines and wilderness, always seeking out the perfect balance to his city-based lifestyle. Marketing Coordinator Madi Garner Madi drives digital marketing efforts across owned and earned channels at Private Equity Info, in support of the platform's mission of delivering targeted M&A intelligence to dealmakers and service providers. She comes to Private Equity Info with a background in financial services marketing. Madi lives in Chicago and spends her free time traveling, hiking, and trying new crafts. Research Director of Research Leslye Fisher Leslye leads PEI’s research team, providing operational guidance and heading up custom research efforts. She was previously employed in technology sales and marketing before beginning her career with Private Equity Info in 2007. She lives in the A