gle family offices. 29 October 2026 – Members New York Annual Dinner Our annual dinner in New York City, bringing together single family office principals and executives from around the world. 22 October 2026 – Members Dinner Munich Our fourth Members’ Dinner in Munich. Members from Germany and beyond are welcome to join. 20 October 2026 – Members Lunch Luxembourg Our first event in Luxembourg. A private, informal meeting among peers of our global single family office community. 24 September 2026 – CIO Roundtable An invitation-only CIO Roundtable bringing together senior investment leaders to discuss asset allocation, investment strategy, and opportunities across private and public markets. 10 September 2026 – Zurich Our fourth Zurich dinner, combining high-quality networking with peer-led discussion. 8 September 2026 – Geneva Our second lunch in Geneva. Long-standing members and first-time attendees alike are welcome. 7 September 2026 – Exclusive Member Visit, Nestlé Research Center, Lausanne An invitation-only visit to the Nestlé Research Center in Lausanne, bringing together selected members to explore research and innovation across deep tech, biotechnology, and agricultural technologies. 3 September 2026 – Monaco Our second Monaco dinner, following last year’s success. 20 August 2026 – Barcelona Our first-ever lunch in Barcelona. Small and intimate by design. 22 July 2026 – Passive vs. Active: The Argument Nobody Wins (But the Data Does) Second in the series, separating industry narratives from what the data actually shows. 25 June 2026 – CIO Roundtable An interactive, open-camera session on asset allocation, strategy and opportunities across private and public markets. 18 June 2026 – The Boring Truth About Asset Classes Opening session of a twelve-part monthly series tackling the questions investors privately ask but rarely get answered straight. 22 May 2026 – SFO Week Social Day A curated programme exploring royal ceremony, tradition, and the art of sabrage. I