Family office in wealth management is a term used for private wealth management services for ultra-high-net-worth individuals ($30+ million). Family offices are the ultimate solution for every aspect of an individual’s finances and investment, unlike traditional private wealth management.

For instance, family office structures provide insurance planning, retirement planning, legacy planning, tax planning, wealth transfer, budgeting, charitable giving, a dedicated private banker, financial guidance for future generations, family governance, and relocation services worldwide.

LFA provides multi-generational advice and services.

