# Aken Capital

## About Aken Capital

Aken Capital is a family office that invests across multiple asset classes including venture capital, private equity, real estate, and capital markets. They focus on high potential opportunities with sensitive valuations in quality businesses located in the UK, US, and Latin America. Their real estate investments include properties like The Plaza on Brickell, Potato Wharf, and various Miami developments, indicating they provide equity capital to real estate projects rather than directly operating properties.

