#### Simon Franco

Founder

Bio

Simon Franco is the Founder of Aken Capital, a family office that invests across real estate, venture capital, private equity, and capital markets. He leads the firm’s multi-asset investment strategy and capital allocation in the United Kingdom, the United States, and Latin America.
An Industrial Engineer from Universidad Javeriana, he holds an MBA from Manchester Business School and completed the PE/VC program at Harvard Business School. A serial entrepreneur, he has founded and developed more than 20 organizations across Colombia, Panama, Brazil, the UK, and the USA, and serves on the board of the British Colombian Chamber of Commerce.

## Industry News [...] #### Fernando Ortiz

Managing Director

Bio

Fernando Ortiz is Managing Director at Aken Capital, where he contributes to investment selection and portfolio allocation across alternatives, including real estate. He brings more than 14 years of experience in corporate finance, investment banking, and alternative investments across Latin America, Europe, and the Middle East.
His expertise spans business valuation, capital raising, M&A, and structuring investment vehicles, advising companies, funds, and family offices on complex cross‑border transactions. He is bilingual in Spanish and English.

