y Contributing to a better, fairer, and more sustainable world. 5. Integrity A consistency and unity of thought and action in every aspect of our organization. Investors We value the strong relationships we have built with our limited partners over the years, which include well-established pension funds, endowments, insurance companies, fund of funds, family offices and other institutional and high net-worth investors. 85+ institutional investors Invested across the Bregal strategies People Our experienced global teams seek to create long-standing relationships and drive lasting impact within our portfolio companies. Leadership People 300+ TEAM MEMBERS Across the US & Europe 30+ NATIONALITIES Represented by our team 9 OFFICES Across the US & Europe Our heritage Bregal Investments was formed in 2002 and is part of COFRA Holding, a privately held group of companies headquartered in Switzerland. COFRA is active in various business sectors and employs more than 60,000 people across its business operations throughout Europe, the Americas, and Asia. COFRA website COFRA LEARN MORE Strategies Our investment teams have distinct strategies and focus on investing in mid-market companies in a variety of sectors in North America and Europe. Responsibility We champion a responsible investment approach focused on creating long-term, sustainable value. People Our firm consists of over 275 professionals including investment teams and corporate support functions. Contact We have offices in nine locations across the US, UK, Germany, Jersey, Switzerland, Luxembourg, and Italy. Sagemount in HEC-Paris Dow Jones Growth Capital Ranking | Bregal Investments News Bregal Sagemount Recognized Among the Top 20 Global Growth Equity Private Equity Firms Date: 09 Jul 2026 Category: Firm news See the full list The 2025 HEC Paris-Dow Jones Growth Capital Performance Ranking lists the world's Top Growth Capital firms in terms of aggregate performance based on all buyout funds raised between 2012 and 