Insight",Emirates Family Office Association,,,2026-07-28T09:57:03.092869,Investment perspectives: Insights from the UAE,,Validation score: 4,Needs Review,,,EXISTING,,,,"The Emirates Family Office Association is the convening platform for family offices, family businesses, and next-generation leaders across the UAE — knowledge transfer, peer connectivity, advocacy, and institutionalisation.",Tavily,,[],"Emirates Family Office Association Skip to main content Emirates Family Office Association Celebrating family legacies, forging enduring connections. A community of family offices in the UAE. EFOA is the premier resource for family offices, family businesses and stakeholders. We empower the next generation with responsibility and knowledge, promote best practices, and provide an exclusive global ecosystem. Become a Member Learn more about EFOA الغاف Our emblem · شعار The Ghaf — Prosopis cineraria The national tree of the UAE. EFOA takes the ghaf as its emblem: patient roots, a generous shade, and a community that meets where the canopy spreads. Note The Emirates Family Office Association is a non-commercial platform that operates with a strict no-solicitation policy. It does not charge any membership fees or other types of fees. Membership is by approval only — ensuring a purely collaborative and open environment for its members. Our mission A strong, collaborative network can make a meaningful impact on the global economic landscape. We celebrate family legacies, foster inter-generational success, and forge meaningful connections — across the UAE and beyond. EFOA exists for the families behind the institutions. We bring together principals, next-gen members, and family-office leaders to share knowledge, navigate transitions, and shape a thriving future for their businesses and their wealth. Through curated convenings, trusted advocacy, and a confidential community of peers, we help families chart the long arc of stewardship from family business to professional family office, and onward. Our values Five principles that guide everything we do. 01 Excellence Consistently striving for excellence and maintaining the highest standards. 02 Empowerment Providing the essential tools and support necessary to achieve success. 03 Independence Encouraging autonomy, self-reliance, and informed decision-making. 04 Accountability Upholding responsibility, ethical practices, and transparency in all actions. 05 Integrity Operating with openness, honesty, and trust in every interaction. What we do Four pillars of community . EFOA is built around the work that matters most to families stewarding capital across generations. 01 Knowledge transfer Programmes, masterclasses, and convenings designed for principals and the next generation, covering governance, succession, investment discipline, and the lived experience of running a family office. 02 Connectivity An exclusive, confidential community of family offices across the seven Emirates and the wider region, connecting peers, ideas, and opportunities through curated dialogue. 03 Policy & advocacy Representing the voice of family capital, engaging with policy-makers, regulators, and ecosystem partners to support best practice, sound regulation, and a constructive operating environment. 04 Institutionalisation Helping family businesses evolve into sophisticated, professionally-run family offices with the right governance, structures, and capabilities to endure across generations. The role of family offices A powerful new force in the global investment ecosystem. Family offices are morphing into a powerful new force in the investment and deals ecosystem: professionalised, active, and direct investors across a wide breadth of sectors and asset classes. They play an essential role in helping business families navigate the complex world of long-term stewardship, legacy, succession, ownership, and wealth management. 0 % Of private capital markets globally are family offices 0 % Increase in family offices 