ommitment, skill, diligence, and innovation are brought into our everyday work and in all of our relationships both internally and externally. We pride ourselves on delivering the highest level of qualitative and quantitative information about investment performance and management with utmost transparency to all of our clients. As an independent financial asset management group, being entrepreneurial is at the core of our activities, by applying an innovative, change-driven, and forward-thinking approach. We strive for excellence in everything we do. Our Investors The GWM Group has a geographically diversified institutional investor base that include pension funds, government agencies, funds of funds and insurance groups. Alongside its limited partner investors, the GWM Group has built long-term relationships with top global investors in its role as operating partner and asset manager of a number of co-investment vehicles. Environmental, Social and Governance Statement The GWM Group acknowledges its responsibilities to contribute to a sustainable future. As such, it is our aim to ensure that we can continuously improve the environmental impact of our business as well as the impact on our community and on society at large, and that our commitment to sound and ethical business conduct is delivered. Discover more Our History Discover more 2000 GWM FOUNDED AS PRIVATE WEALTH MANAGER AND MFO 2004 LAUNCH OF MULTI STRATEGY FUND OF FUNDS 2011 LAUNCH OF EUROPA PLUS / FUND I 2013 STARTED COOPERATION WITH LARGE INSTITUTIONAL INVESTORS 2015 GWM SENIOR MANAGERS ACQUIRE CONTROL 2017 LAUNCH OF EVENT DRIVEN / MERGER ARBITRAGE STRATEGY 2018 LAUNCH OF IRESS / FUND II 2020 LAUNCH OF CREDO Fund 2021 LAUNCH OF DEDICATED MERGER ARBITRAGE FUND 2022 SALE OF AREC TO ILLIMITY BANK 2023 EXPECTED LAUNCH OF REAL ESTATE SPECIAL SITUATIONS / FUND III AND THE UCITS VERSION OF THE MERGER ARBITRAGE FUND",
