### About ASIAMIN CAPITAL ADVISORS PTE. LTD.

ASIAMIN CAPITAL Advisors Pte. Ltd. is a Single Family Office based in Singapore, established in 2007, regulated by the Monetary Authority of Singapore. The Family Office oversees the capital allocation function of the group’s global financial resources, monitored internally as The ASIAMIN Fund. The ASIAMIN Group has a track record since 1993 in wealth creation through various businesses. The fund holds positions in approximately 15 high quality and best managed businesses globally in a concentrated equity only focussed portfolio.

