ca1a35b4-e39e-40bf-a716-5bfc88af9f26,Diversified Holding Company,https://andsimple.co/insights/family-offices-singapore,VERIFIED_FAMILY_OFFICE,0.95,Verified via explicit name cross-matching and signature patterns.,10,,,"| No. | Name | Founded | Founder / Key Figure | Type | Key Focus & Sectors |
