requent communication and attention to your needs. We truly believe an informed investor is a better client. We believe in avoiding the day-to-day market noise and related emotions, which can easily sabotage your long-term success. Long-term investment success is based on time-tested, Nobel Prize-winning research, proper asset allocation, low costs, tax sensitivity and strict discipline to these core concepts. We do not aim to time the market, pick ""winners"" or take oversized risks to outperform the market. Our business practices are guided by our five Core Values: Integrity, trust, transparency, accountability, and competency your_team YOUR TEAM Transparent communication, expert knowledge, and total trust and confidence in investment advisor is a necessity. While Taurus Capital Management may be your guide through the investment and financial planning process, our clients are always best served when they are informed and involved. We never forget that we are here to help you plan your financial future; your thoughts, ideas and concerns will always be heard. GREGORY SALIBA PRESIDENT Tel: (503) 756-2972 saliba@tauruscap.com biography JULIE CONNOR VICE PRESIDENT Tel: (206) 714-2424 julie@tauruscap.com biography AMY OH CPA, CFP® SENIOR ADVISOR Tel: (503) 887-4446 amy@tauruscap.com biography PETER DE GRAFF CFA®, CFP® SENIOR ADVISOR SKYE TROY CLIENT SERVICES Tel: (503) 747-8708 peter@tauruscap.com Tel: (503) 705-8835 skye@tauruscap.com HOW CAN WE HELP? CONTACT US Email Phone: (503) 756-2972 Text: (503) 658-9529 ​ For general inquiries, please fill out the following contact form: Success! Message received. SEND OUR ADDRESS 16325 Boones Fer ry Road, Suite 203, Lake Oswego, OR 97035 contact For mobile access, download the Schwab Mobile® app in the App Store. Access your Financial Planning portal BACK TO TOP CLIENT RESOURCES Access your account online: Client Resources bottom of page",
