lth, including multiple family members, entities, estates, or trusts Want to preserve and transfer your legacy—ensuring your family’s values, vision, and assets endure across generations Need centralized coordination across advisors, accounts, planning strategies, and governance structures Require specialized expertise in tax strategy, estate structuring, family governance, or philanthropic design Are navigating significant financial or life events, such as succession planning, business transitions, or major charitable initiatives Corporate Advisory and/or Tax services offered by Digital Insurance LLC (""OneDigital""). Investment advisory services offered through OneDigital Investment Advisors LLC (""ODIA""), an affiliate of Digital Insurance LLC.. Securities offered through M Holdings Securities, Inc. (“M Securities”), a registered broker/dealer, member FINRA/SIPC. Insurance products offered by KJAC Partners LLC d/b/a KB Financial Partners (NPN# 16530783). OneDigital, M Securities and KJAC Partners LLC are independent and unaffiliated Entities. For important information related to M Securities, refer to the M Securities’ Client Relationship Summary (Form CRS) by navigating to https://brokercheck.finra.org/firm/summary/43285.",
