International, multi-sector conglomerate holding company, investing in businesses with high-growth potential in UAE, USA, UK and Europe.","Graeme Carling | International investor, chairman, and founder",,,2026-07-28T10:00:53.543808,The Carling Group - Private Family Office,,Validation score: 6,Verified,,,EXISTING,,,,"Graeme Carling is an international investor, chairman and founder with business interests in multiple sectors around the world.",Tavily,,['fraser@thecarlinggroup.co.uk'],"Graeme Carling | International investor, chairman, and founder THE BUSINESSES Graeme is an experienced and successful businessman with investments in real estate, building services, healthcare, pharma, and tech. A driven and passionate entrepreneur with a direct and unwavering style. Graeme identifies fragmented sectors, with high growth potential and brings vast experience in consolidation and acquisitions to create shareholder value. International private family investment office of Leanne and Graeme Carling. Holds interests in healthcare, IT, and renewable energy. International, multi-sector conglomerate holding company, investing in businesses with high-growth potential in UAE, USA, UK and Europe. Investing in the UK building and home services sector. United Capital has grown from start-up to £50million turnover in three years, through the Covid period. A THOUGHT LEADER & UNIQUE VOICE Graeme is an established business commentator and thought leader with a direct and passionate style who is invited to deliver keynote speeches, to speak on business shows, podcasts and participate in media interviews. Graeme is an expert in leadership, business finance, growth, and mergers & acquisitions, and is invited to speak regularly about personal mindset, business education, and running a business with your partner. COMMITTED TO CHARITY Graeme and his family believe deeply in philanthropy and in giving. The Carling family have given time and money to many charities over the years; from leading national charities, to fundraising for local causes. Graeme and has family want to feel connected to the charities they support and to donate their time as well as funds. Disabled and autistic children’s charity founded by UK Billionaire and philanthropist John Caudwell, Caudwell Children, and international type-1 diabetes research charity, JDRF, are the family’s two chosen charities and the Carlings have committed to support both for the long-term. MOUNT EVEREST CLIMB FOR A CURE FOR JDRF A gruelling 8-day trek up through the Himalayas to Base Camp Everest to raise money for JDRF. Read the full story here PLEDGING £1MILLION TO CAUDWELL CHILDREN The Carlings announce a £1million pledge to Caudwell Children and join John Caudwell’s Life-Changers Circle. Read the full story here VIETNAM TO CAMBODIA CYCLE FOR JDRF Graeme and Leanne cycle over 400km in 7 days from Ho Chi Minh City in Vietnam to Siem Reap in Cambodia for JDRF. Read the full story here ENTREPRENEURIAL INSIGHTS Entrepreneurial Insights is a collection of reflections from Graeme Carling’s journey in business. Drawing on decades of experience building, investing in, and transforming companies, he shares perspectives on the realities of entrepreneurship; the decisions, challenges, successes and setbacks that shape the path. These insights are grounded in real experience and intended to offer practical perspective for others navigating the world of business and enterprise. Underestimated? Lucky you! Read full story here God loves a trier Read full story here Nostalgia Doesn’t Make Money…It Destroys Fortunes Read full story here Media Enquiries please contact Fraser Kirk on T: +44 (0) 7531 090912 | E: fraser@thecarlinggroup.co.uk Copyright © 2025 Graeme Carling by Comms International Ltd. LinkedIn Twitter Instagram Medium Spotify YouTube",
