## Project Impact and Alignment with Sustainable Development Goals (SDGs)",TBH Global Family Office SA - Boutique Swiss Asset Manager,,,2026-07-28T10:01:26.831994,Asset Manager Code™,,Validation score: 4,Needs Review,,,EXISTING,,,,"Discover TBH Global Family Office SA, a Geneva-based asset manager specializing in personalized wealth management for high-net-worth and ultra-high-net-worth clients.",Tavily,,[],"TBH Global Family Office SA - Boutique Swiss Asset Manager TBH Global Family Office SA - Boutique Swiss Asset Manager LinkedIn ← Previous Next → TBH Global Family Office SA: Tailored Wealth Management for High-Net-Worth Clients Finance Switzerland About TBH Global Family Office SA TBH Global Family Office SA is a boutique asset manager in Geneva, specializing in wealth management for high-net-worth and ultra-high-net-worth clients. Founded in 2020, the firm is fully licensed by FINMA and focuses on personalized service within a robust regulatory framework. With a commitment to sustainability and innovation, TBH aims to provide tailored financial solutions… SIMILAR TOPICS : asset management , FINMA , Geneva , high-net-worth , Sustainable Finance , wealth management What is TBH Global Family Office SA? TBH Global Family Office SA is a boutique independent Swiss asset manager based in Geneva. Founded in 2020, it specializes in wealth management services tailored for high-net-worth (HNW) and ultra-high-net-worth (UHNW) private clients. This firm stands out by combining personalized service with the robust regulatory framework of Switzerland, making it a trusted name in asset management. Oh, and it’s fully licensed by FINMA since November 2021, which means it operates under strict Swiss financial regulations. Main Benefits of TBH Global Family Office SA Here’s a quick snapshot of what makes TBH tick: Founded in 2020, bringing fresh and modern approaches to asset management Licensed by FINMA, Switzerland’s financial market supervisory authority, since November 2021 Based in Geneva, a global hub for wealth management and finance Focuses exclusively on HNW and UHNW private clients, ensuring tailored and discreet service Monitored by OSIF, adding an extra layer of oversight and trust Registered under CHE-161.316.450, confirming its official Swiss company status Location and Contact Details TBH Global Family Office SA operates from its office at Rue Pedro-Meylan 1, CH–1208 Genève. Geneva is not just a picturesque city; it’s also a powerhouse in global finance, making it the perfect base for a boutique asset manager. Clients can reach out directly or connect through their professional LinkedIn page, which keeps the firm accessible and transparent. Licensing and Regulatory Framework One of the key pillars of TBH’s credibility is its licensing by FINMA, the Swiss Financial Market Supervisory Authority. This license, granted in November 2021, ensures that TBH adheres to the highest standards of compliance and governance. Additionally, the firm is monitored by OSIF, which further guarantees that operations meet stringent Swiss regulatory requirements. This dual oversight provides clients with peace of mind, knowing their assets are managed within a secure and well-regulated environment. Brand Identity and Online Presence TBH Global Family Office SA carries a strong brand identity, symbolized by its distinctive logo, which can be viewed on their official website. The logo reflects the firm’s commitment to professionalism and trust. Their website, https://tbh-gfo.com/ , offers a clean, user-friendly experience, providing essential information without overwhelming visitors. Plus, their LinkedIn profile keeps clients and prospects updated on company news and insights, fostering a sense of community and engagement. Project Impact and Alignment with Sustainable Development Goals (SDGs) SDG 8: Decent Work and Economic Growth – by promoting sustainable wealth management practices SDG 9: Industry, Innovation, and Infrastructure – through innovative asset management solutions SDG 16: Peace, Justice, and Strong Institutions – by operating under strict regulatory frameworks ensuring transparency and accountability Disclaimer and Usage of Information The information provided by TBH Global Family Office SA is intended solely to offer a profile of the company. It’s important to note that this content isn’t meant for reproduction or use beyond this purpose. The details and opinions shared are background information only and don’t claim to be exhaustive or fully accurate. No one should rely solely on this info for investment decisions, nor should it be seen as an offer or solicitation to buy or sell any securities or services. Also, any such offers are subject to legal restrictions depending on the jurisdiction. So, while the info is helpful, it’s always wise to consult directly with the firm or a financial advisor for tailored advice. Discover other innovative projects : 50 Innovative Sustainable Projects in Spain Driving Development Goals 50 Innovative Sustainable Projects Transforming Switzerland’s Future 50 Sustainable Projects in France Shaping a Greener Future 50 Innovative Sustainable Projects in the United Kingdom Driving Change Learn more about the Sustainable Development Goals : Ranking SDGs Countries Maps Browse : Follow us to get more news ! LinkedIn © 2025 Keys for Tomorrow Scroll to top Scroll to top",
