rough curated convenings, trusted advocacy, and a confidential community of peers, we help families chart the long arc of stewardship from family business to professional family office, and onward. Our values Five principles that guide everything we do. 01 Excellence Consistently striving for excellence and maintaining the highest standards. 02 Empowerment Providing the essential tools and support necessary to achieve success. 03 Independence Encouraging autonomy, self-reliance, and informed decision-making. 04 Accountability Upholding responsibility, ethical practices, and transparency in all actions. 05 Integrity Operating with openness, honesty, and trust in every interaction. What we do Four pillars of community . EFOA is built around the work that matters most to families stewarding capital across generations. 01 Knowledge transfer Programmes, masterclasses, and convenings designed for principals and the next generation, covering governance, succession, investment discipline, and the lived experience of running a family office. 02 Connectivity An exclusive, confidential community of family offices across the seven Emirates and the wider region, connecting peers, ideas, and opportunities through curated dialogue. 03 Policy & advocacy Representing the voice of family capital, engaging with policy-makers, regulators, and ecosystem partners to support best practice, sound regulation, and a constructive operating environment. 04 Institutionalisation Helping family businesses evolve into sophisticated, professionally-run family offices with the right governance, structures, and capabilities to endure across generations. The role of family offices A powerful new force in the global investment ecosystem. Family offices are morphing into a powerful new force in the investment and deals ecosystem: professionalised, active, and direct investors across a wide breadth of sectors and asset classes. They play an essential role in helping business families navigate the complex world of long-term stewardship, legacy, succession, ownership, and wealth management. 0 % Of private capital markets globally are family offices 0 % Increase in family offices worldwide since 2017 $ 0.0 T Of AUM under family offices globally 0 % Of the UAE's private sector are family businesses Upcoming convenings Where the community comes together . All events 29 Jul · 2026 Private Markets Access: Co-Investment Platforms Co-investment specialist + FO with co-invest programme 11:00 AM Online event Details → 05 Aug · 2026 The Family Office and Family Business: Managing the Relationship FO principal with family business + governance specialist 11:00 AM Online event Details → 06 Aug · 2026 Designing Your Family Office Annual Report Reporting specialist 11:00 AM Online event Details → News & Insights Perspectives on family capital and legacy . All insights Insight Abu Dhabi Investment Office and Emirates Family Office Association partner to attract and enable long-term private capital EFOA Editorial · Jul 2025 Opens in a new tab Insight Joud Aboud, EVP of Ghassan Aboud Group, and Emirates Family Office Association host landmark GCC-Asia Cross-Industry Leadership Event ahead of Token2049 EFOA Editorial · May 2025 Opens in a new tab Insight Emirates Family Office Association appoints chairman EFOA Editorial · Apr 2025 Opens in a new tab Join our exclusive community . Unlock access to programmes, peer dialogue, and curated events designed for family offices and family businesses across the UAE. Membership is by approval only. Become a Member Get in touch Subscribe to our insights Receive captivating perspectives on assets, funds, and family-office matters, delivered to your inbox. Email address Subscribe Partners & sponsors In partnership with the institutions shaping family capital in the UAE Explore the network → Programme partners & sponsors United Arab Emirates University Advancing Knowledge & Next-Generation Leadership MEVCA Connecting Family Capital with Venture Abu Dhabi Global Market ADGM The Home of Family Offices in Abu Dhabi AFFO Uniting Family Enterprise Across Borders Win.d Powering Smarter Solutions for Family Offices Thabat Transforming Family Businesses for the Future Economy Collab Ventures Where Ideas & Networks Converge SuperReturn Middle East The Region's Premier Private Markets Gathering IPEM Bridging Family Capital & Global Private Equity Hong Kong Academy for Wealth Legacy HKAWL Connecting East & West in Legacy Building LEAP Global Partners Connecting Family Capital with Cross-Border Innovation Aleria (IHC) Intelligent Decision-Making for the Boardroom and Beyond ADGM Academy Building the Talent Behind Family Wealth Abu Dhabi Investment Office (ADIO) Empowering Investors to Thrive with Abu Dhabi Financial Times (FT) Trusted Insight for Decision-Makers Worldwide UAE International Investors Council (UAEIIC) × Ministry of Economy and Tourism (MoET) The UAE's Federal Economic Leadership and Global Investment Community — United in Support of Emirati Investment Worldwide About | Emirates Family Office Association Skip to main content About EFOA An association built on stewardship, knowledge, and trust. EFOA — the Emirates Family Office Association — is the dedicated voice and convening platform for family offices, family businesses, and stakeholders across the United Arab Emirates. We exist to professionalise the institution of family wealth in the UAE and to safeguard its inter-generational continuity. Our Mission A platform for the long arc. EFOA empowers the next generation of family-office leaders with responsibility, education, and access. We promote best practices in governance and succession, and we connect family principals across the UAE to share what works and what to avoid. Our work is anchored in the UAE's tradition of intergenerational stewardship — and oriented toward the country's role as the leading global hub for private capital. We are non-political, non-commercial, and members-only by approval. Our Pillars Four commitments to our members. الانتقال Knowledge Transfer Curated learning programmes — from foundational governance to advanced topics in tax, family constitutions, and structuring — designed for principals and next-gen leaders. الاتصال Connectivity Closed-room peer dialogue across emirates and generations. Members meet in trusted, off-the-record formats that foster honest exchange. المناصرة Advocacy We represent the collective voice of UAE family offices to regulators, financial-free-zones, and government stakeholders. المأسسة Institutionalisation Best-practice ",
