### Company portrait

### Who we are

Since its beginnings as a cloth merchant in 1674, Bankhaus Metzler has consistently pursued its own path: We are independent in every respect and work exclusively in the interests of our clients. Like no other, Bankhaus Metzler has been interwoven with the Frankfurt financial centre for centuries.  
The benchmark for Metzler's own principles is the benefit for our customers. Our thoughts and actions are geared to this. With our excellent capital market know-how, many years of experience, proximity to global stock markets and innovative technology, we achieve internationally recognized top performances for our customers.

