About CSSP Holding GmbH:

CSSP-Holding GmbH is a family-run investment company based in Munich and Salzburg that specializes in the acquisition and operational development of small and medium-sized companies in the DACH region. The CSSP focuses on the acquisition of companies with an annual turnover of between 5 and 150 million euros in the manufacturing industry as well as on trading and service companies.

