dd5742ac-d098-4187-8ec7-bbc4d5ec5406,Family Office,https://www.feri.de/en/investment-advice/family-office,VERIFIED_FAMILY_OFFICE,0.95,Verified via explicit name cross-matching and signature patterns.,6,,,,Family Office,,,2026-07-28T10:03:29.950351,Family Office,,Validation score: 10,Verified,,fag@feri.de,EXISTING,,,8-10 61348,,Tavily,,[],"Family Office Family Office Tailored Solutions for Your Family and Finances At the Family Office, we develop solutions that perfectly align with your individual needs. Our services are always built on our deep understanding of capital markets. As your central point of contact, we coordinate everything from strategic structuring to investment and succession planning. More than simply optimizing your risk-return profile, this is about trust, values and protecting the things that matter to you for the future. In our experience, family structures and financial planning often overlap. Adding an operational family business into the mix brings a whole set of additional factors to consider. That is why the key to our approach is understanding how finances, legal considerations, business interests and personal relationships interact: only when they are all in harmony can you truly secure the future you want. The FERI Family Office: Expertise, Independence and Vision No two families are the same. When FERI’s founding family started the company more than 30 years ago, their idea was to provide solutions as unique as each family’s values, goals and needs. Since that time, we have been advising generations of discerning families on every aspect of wealth management with expertise, independence and long-term vision. Your benefits Our holistic approach keeps all aspects in harmony. Preserving value over generations Integrating finances, tax, legal aspects and your family values Access to all FERI’s expertise – including the FERI Cognitive Finance Institute and FERI SDG Office Digital overview of all your assets with user-specific access rights Clear decision-making structures and proven processes – protecting you even in complex situations With us, you will have a partner at your side who understands your values and has the vision to guide you safely to your goals – a constructive sparring partner with family roots, backed by institutional expertise. Unser Ansatz Clarity, Security and a Long-Term Mindset – The Structured Way to Achieve Your Goals Our consulting approach combines three key aspects: Strategy consulting: The right structure for your wealth management Successful wealth planning begins with clear foundations. We develop an individual strategy that takes into account personal and family circumstances, tax and legal considerations, and risk, return and liquidity requirements. Our goal is to create a robust wealth architecture that is built to last. Implementation: Structured processes and superior selection To optimize your wealth management, we define clear investment policies with you and choose the right asset managers and service providers for the job. Control and transparency: Clarity at every step To ensure you are always fully in the loop, we look after reporting, controlling and risk management for your liquid and illiquid assets. We regularly analyze performance, cost and investment policies to efficiently manage your portfolio, and re-evaluate the strategy if your family situation or the market environment changes. With this structured approach, we provide clarity, security and a long-term mindset. Your contact Contact us to learn more about how we can support you and your family. Michael Jänsch Executive Managing Director, Wealth Management & Family Office Wealth Management",
