4983c37e-e3e8-4287-88dd-f6f6d49e87d2,Consolidated wealth of the Thomson family (Thomson Reuters).,https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nbSZD8sKD08,NOT_FAMILY_OFFICE,0.0,Skipped: Pre-rejected in discovery phase with no local domain signatures available.,0,,,"The Thomson family’s wealth, amounting to approximately $61.3 billion, places them among the wealthiest globally. 

Their primary business, The Woodbridge Company, is the parent company of the media giant Thomson Reuters, which began as a modest radio station in 1930s Ontario. 

