Our Story & Approach

### Continuum is the family office and investment management company for Doug & Maria DeVos, and their family.

Founded in 2020, we seek to match purpose and pursuits by building innovative companies, stronger communities, and transformative projects that positively impact people’s lives. We recognize that partnership is vital to progress—in every part of our work. We build deep relationships, create lasting experiences, and pursue bold visions that our partners share. Always building from our faith, we recognize people’s God-given talents and strive to achieve more together than we ever could alone.

