## Dancap Family Investment Office is a Single Family Office based out of Toronto, Canada, that manages the investment portfolio for Aubrey Dan. [...] At the Aubrey & Marla Dan Foundation leadership is important to us. Our belief is that giving is about more than money, it’s about using our business and investment acumen, our time and our connections to help organizations thrive. We’ve supported numerous projects over the years that fall into three pillars: community, healthcare, and education.

